flowchart LR
    SPA[SPA web] --> EDGE[CloudFront + WAF + S3]
    APP[App móvil] --> WAF[AWS WAF]
    EDGE --> WAF
    WAF --> API[API Gateway]
    API --> LINK[VPC Link + balanceador privado]
    LINK --> SERVICES[ECS Fargate en dos AZ]
    SERVICES --> RDS[RDS PostgreSQL Multi-AZ]
    SERVICES --> READ[DynamoDB proyección frecuente]
    RDS --> BUS[EventBridge + SQS/DLQ]
    BUS --> AUDIT[Auditoría]
    BUS --> NOTIFY[Notificaciones]
    AUDIT --> ARCHIVE[S3 Object Lock]
    NOTIFY --> EMAIL[Correo]
    NOTIFY --> PUSH[Push o SMS]
    SERVICES --> EXT[Core, detalle, pagos, IdP, biometría]
